Package: PGLasso
Type: Package
Title: Propagation-Guided Lasso for Sparse Network Intervention
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("PGLasso", "Research Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hageman@buffalo.edu")
Description: Estimates sparse interventions that move a network from an initial
    state toward a target state using PRINCE network propagation and constrained
    lasso regression. Includes a reconstructed NORSP-style forward-selection
    comparison and reproducible simulated-network demonstrations. The functions
    operate on network adjacency matrices and do not require nonlinear kinetic
    models.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: glmnet
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
